<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Nov 1996 inflation up 3.17 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Nov 1996 inflation up 3.17 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's consumer prices rose 0.11 percent in November against 1.81 percent in October, Bureau of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise was 3.17 percent.</p>
<p>Bangladesh consumer prices:</p>
<p>				     November  October  November 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change    0.11	 1.81	0.12</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	3.17	 3.18	5.0</p>
<p>    Index (base 1973-74=100) 844	  843	 818</p>
</text>
